{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
Play in '''Group A of the [[1990 FIFA World Cup]]''' completed on 19 June 1990. [[Italy national football team|Italy]] won the group and advanced to the second round, along with [[Czechoslovakia national football team|Czechoslovakia]]. [[Austria national football team|Austria]] and the [[United States men's national soccer team|United States]] failed to advance.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/90full.html |title=World Cup 1990 |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

